$\\operatorname{arcsec} ,$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec} (u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{3}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{3}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{3}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{3{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{|\\sqrt{3}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsec} u+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsec} (\\sqrt{3}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250176 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00c4a36b-1ea2-5c73-8a8e-897727eb8f12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{6}\\,\\operatorname{arcsec} (x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247419} {:answer/id #uuid "1a99f5d4-adb5-558f-ab9d-871641a6895a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec} (\\sqrt{6}x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247666} {:answer/id #uuid "473a1c85-0e25-55e8-9960-af9d6576e38d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "6\\,\\operatorname{arcsec} (\\sqrt{6}x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248058} {:answer/id #uuid "612053c7-5fa5-581e-863a-77db7fe44da7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec} \\left(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{6}}\\right)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248304} {:answer/id #uuid "96a16219-09aa-5a3c-a6f7-b42ee02e1ec9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\sqrt{6}\\,\\operatorname{arcsec} (x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248763}] :answer-fiel