\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{8\\sqrt{8}}{|\\sqrt{8}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{8}x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\operatorname{arcsec} ,$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec} (u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{8}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{8}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{8}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{8}{|x|\\sqrt{8{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{8\\sqrt{8}}{|\\sqrt{8}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{8}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8\\sqrt{8}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =8\\sqrt{8}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =8\\,\\operatorname{arcsec} u+C \\\\  & =8\\,\\operatorname{arcsec} (\\sqrt{8}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250179 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20eeed43-06fc-5a51-a569-cc359295eeb2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec} (50x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247713} {:answer/id #uuid "23a4faf6-7048-5692-877b-730a3aa48b44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec} (10x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186247737} {:answer/id #uuid "860a98b5-c89e-5a98-a319-70c942ace928" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\operatorname{arcsec} (10x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186248619} {:answer/id #uuid "c1ea824c-8f8e-5257-ae08-86f03dfd7210" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "5\\,\\operatorname{arcsec} (10x)+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186249149} {:answer/id #uuid "d7024181-5209-53f4-9e77-1d70e6a37869" :answer/type {:d